  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection and Empowerment of Women for Equality,  Imprest Request No. 18</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">POWERED project aims to support implementation of the Gender Equality and Women&#x2019;s Empowerment (GEWE) Policy, which was launched in December 2020. The project has two main objectives: (a) supportive policy and socio political environment in place to ensure gender-responsive implementation with effective monitoring of the GEWE policy and the gender elements of the Meduim Tem National Development Plan (2019-2023) with particular focus on the protection, and socio- political representation opportunities of women to reduce gender inequality.(b) Support UN Women Institutional Strengthening.</narrative>
  </description>
